      "versionNonce": 926164091,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776179214513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "local development environment\n    - install all the stuff. \n    - run it containers\n    - \"docker compose\"\n        - a yaml file that lets you\n         startup and control a bunch\n         of containers.\n    - Aspire\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "local development environment\n    - install all the stuff. \n    - run it containers\n    - \"docker compose\"\n        - a yaml file that lets you\n         startup and control a bunch\n         of containers.\n    - Aspire\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "F_0OP3rJ7T-uS2XEYja28",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47.5,
      "y": 1852,
      "width": 721.7395629882812,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1566347003,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 289150747,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776179249983,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Aspire can also \"publish\"\n    - You can use it to create the manifests to deploy to K8S/Open Shift\n    - Azure\n    - AWS\n    - Etc. etc.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
